  "description": "SEO Report for Umbraco: a Content-section dashboard that turns Google Analytics 4 and Google Search Console into a monthly SEO report. It archives each month's traffic, search visibility, top pages and queries, compares them with the previous month and the same month last year, follows targets and notes, and explains what changed in plain English. Connect it with a Google service account; the key is stored encrypted.",
